===Etymology===
{{L.}} [[petra]], ''[[stone]]'' + {{Gr.}} stem of present paticiple ''myzont-'', from [[μύζω]] (myzo), ''to [[suckle]]''; i.e. "that suckles" + scientific suffix [[-idae]].

